  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#333333\"><a name=\"top\"></a></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\" background=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n\n<font class=\"combo\" id=\"combos\" style=\"cursor:hand;\" title=\"원래 표기: Catalog*******\">Catalog</font>\n<div id=\"myDIV\">\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_alchemy/\" title=\"연금술[포션제작]\">Alchemy+</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_poisoning/\" title=\"포이즈닝[독바르기]\">Poisoning</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_taste/\" title=\"맛감정\">Taste ID</a><br>\n\t\t\t------------\n\t\t\t<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_blacksmith/\" title=\"스미스[대장장이]\">Black Smith+</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_mining/\" title=\"광부[광물캐기]\">Mining</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_armslore/\" title=\"암즈로어[장비지식]\">Arms Lore</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_item/\" title=\"아이템ID[아이템감정]\">Item ID</a><br>\n                        ------------\n\t\t\t<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_car/\" title=\"카펜터리[목공술]\">Carpentry</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_lumber/\" title=\"럼버잭[나무하기]\">Lumberjacking</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_thinker/\" title=\"팅거링[기계공기술]\">Tinkering</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_bow/\" title=\"보우크래프트[활제작술]\">Bowcraft</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_fishing/\" title=\"피싱[낚시]\">Fishing</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_ins/\" title=\"인스크립션[기록술]\">Inscription</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_tailor/\" title=\"재단사[재봉술]\">Tailor</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_cooking/\" title=\"쿠킹[요리]\">Cooking</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_begging/\" title=\"베깅[구걸]\">Begging</a><br><br>\n</div><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/left_menu/jobs_logo.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"17\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:200/17\" width=\"200\">\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font>&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/alpha/alpha_background.gif\" height=\"30\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/left_menu/alpha/i.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/30\" width=\"30\">TEM \n                            ID</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/alpha/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#A0965A\" bordercolordark=\"#999933\" bordercolorlight=\"#A0965A\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/alpha/alpha_background_2.gif\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"544\">\n<p><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 아이템 감정</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" height=\"40\" width=\"544\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">아이템감정의 \n                            스킬은 감정 지팡이의 존재로 인하여많은 사람들이 \n                            올리지 않는 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬중의 \n                            하나입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">하지만 \n                            스킬이 30정도만 되도 그아이템의 성능을 알아 볼 수 \n                            있다는 메리트가 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"115\" width=\"150\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"120\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/itemid/id_1.gif\" width=\"170\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"115\" width=\"390\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">좌측글씨에 \n                            substantial은 무기류에+10 to item HP내구력</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">accurate는무기류에 \n                            +5.0 to Tactics</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">ruin은 +1 damage \n                            의 효과를 주는 axe로 판정이 나옵니다</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">p.s \n                : 맨밑에 78골드는 아이템을 벤더에게 팔 때  나오는 수치이지만 \n                스킬이</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">낮을 \n                때는 정확하지 않습니다 일반적으로 낮게 나옵니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#A0965A\" bordercolordark=\"#999933\" bordercolorlight=\"#A0965A\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/alpha/alpha_background_2.gif\" colspan=\"4\" height=\"30\" width=\"544\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;감정 \n                            지팡이</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"100\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/itemid/id_2.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"170\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">1.리치등을 \n                            잡으면</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">마법완드를 \n                            획득할 수</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">있습니다. \n                            </span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"42\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/itemid/wand_1.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"220\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">2.완드를 \n                            손에 든채</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">더블클릭하여</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">자신의 \n                            캐릭터를 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">클릭해서 \n                            자신의 이름이</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">나오는 \n                            것이 감정지팡이</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;p.s : 하나씩 순서대로 놓으실 때는 탁자다리에다 놓아줍니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">손쉽게 아이템들을 놓을 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Written \n                By Forg</span></font></b></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"\" bordercolor=\"#A0965A\" bordercolordark=\"#999933\" bordercolorlight=\"#A0965A\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"500\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" background=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/alpha/alpha_background_2.gif\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"25\" width=\"478\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;갑옷류</span></b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#E4E4E4\" height=\"25\" width=\"237\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">접두사</span></b></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#E4E4E4\" height=\"25\" width=\"237\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">효과</span></b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"237\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Durable</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"237\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">+5 to item HP</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"237\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Substantial</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"237\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">+10 to item HP</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"237\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Massive</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"237\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">+15 to item HP</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"237\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Fortified</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"237\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">+20 to item HP</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"237\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Indestructible</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"237\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">+25 to item HP</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"silver\" height=\"25\" width=\"237\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style